<ol class="refs">
  <li id="thy-r1"><span class="rf-for">雑音の模型、硬い・柔らかい閾値、普遍閾値（VisuShrink）、σ̂ の推定（4.2 節）</span><span class="rf-src">D. L. Donoho and I. M. Johnstone, “Ideal spatial adaptation by wavelet shrinkage,” <i>Biometrika</i>, vol. 81, no. 3, pp. 425–455, 1994, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/biomet/81.3.425" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1093/biomet/81.3.425</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r2"><span class="rf-for">SURE（式 (6)）、疎な段での切り替え（2.4 節）、SureShrink</span><span class="rf-src">D. L. Donoho and I. M. Johnstone, “Adapting to unknown smoothness via wavelet shrinkage,” <i>Journal of the American Statistical Association</i>, vol. 90, no. 432, pp. 1200–1224, 1995, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/01621459.1995.10476626" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1080/01621459.1995.10476626</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r3"><span class="rf-for">柔らかい閾値の滑らかさ</span><span class="rf-src">D. L. Donoho, “De-noising by soft-thresholding,” <i>IEEE Transactions on Information Theory</i>, vol. 41, no. 3, pp. 613–627, 1995, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/18.382009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1109/18.382009</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r4"><span class="rf-for">BayesShrink（式 (12)・(19)・(20)）</span><span class="rf-src">S. G. Chang, B. Yu, and M. Vetterli, “Adaptive wavelet thresholding for image denoising and compression,” <i>IEEE Transactions on Image Processing</i>, vol. 9, no. 9, pp. 1532–1546, 2000, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/83.862633" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1109/83.862633</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r5"><span class="rf-for">段ごとの σ の推定（式 (4)）</span><span class="rf-src">I. M. Johnstone, “Wavelet shrinkage for correlated data and inverse problems: adaptivity results,” <i>Statistica Sinica</i>, vol. 9, pp. 51–83, 1999</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r6"><span class="rf-for">相関のある雑音での段ごとの閾値</span><span class="rf-src">I. M. Johnstone and B. W. Silverman, “Wavelet threshold estimators for data with correlated noise,” <i>Journal of the Royal Statistical Society: Series B</i>, vol. 59, no. 2, pp. 319–351, 1997, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1111/1467-9868.00071" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1111/1467-9868.00071</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r7"><span class="rf-for">ずらして平均（式 (1)・表 2）、擬似ギブス現象</span><span class="rf-src">R. R. Coifman and D. L. Donoho, “Translation-invariant de-noising,” in <i>Wavelets and Statistics</i>, Lecture Notes in Statistics, vol. 103, Springer, 1995, pp. 125–150, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4612-2544-7_9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1007/978-1-4612-2544-7_9</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r8"><span class="rf-for">位置と値のビット数（式 (9)・(10)）、誤差の分解（式 (11)・(13)）</span><span class="rf-src">S. Mallat and F. Falzon, “Analysis of low bit rate image transform coding,” <i>IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing</i>, vol. 46, no. 4, pp. 1027–1042, 1998, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/78.668554" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1109/78.668554</a></span></li>
  <li id="thy-r9"><span class="rf-for">JPEG 2000 の量子化（式 (4)）、9/7 と 5/3、ビットプレーンの符号化</span><span class="rf-src">A. Skodras, C. Christopoulos, and T. Ebrahimi, “The JPEG 2000 still image compression standard,” <i>IEEE Signal Processing Magazine</i>, vol. 18, no. 5, pp. 36–58, 2001, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/79.952804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1109/79.952804</a></span></li>
